Two pitfalls to avoid here specifically:

- **Don't skip the baseline assertion.** If you only test "nothing runs after dispose," a store whose autorun was broken/non-firing all along passes, and you've proven nothing.
- **Don't loosen `enforceActions`** to seed the store's initial state directly; go through an action or `runInAction`, so this test exercises the same discipline the real app uses.

